-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Custom Scan (DocumentDBApiExplainQueryScan) (actual rows=1 loops=1)
   namespaceName: rumget_db.rumget_multikey
   indexName: a_1
   indexKey: {"a": 1}
   isMultiKey: true
   multiKeyPaths: a
   indexBounds: ["a": (5, Infinity]], ["a": [-Infinity, 4)]
   innerScanLoops: 3 loops
   scanType: regular
   scanKeyDetails: key 1: [(isInequality: true, estimatedEntryCount: 4), (isInequality: true, estimatedEntryCount: 1)]
   ->  Index Scan using a_1 on documents_1702 collection (actual rows=1 loops=1)
